@startuml
title Workload Instance State Machine
[*] --> APPLYING : Apply manifests
APPLYING --> READY : WaitReady succeeds
READY --> APPLYING : update workload
READY --> REMOVING : remove workload
REMOVING --> REMOVED : Delete succeeds
APPLYING --> FAILED : apply/readiness error
REMOVING --> FAILED : delete error
REMOVED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
@enduml
